Sub2API Fusion Builder

This repository coordinates builds from two independently maintained upstream
projects. It is not an official release channel for either project.

Official Sub2API:
  https://github.com/Wei-Shaw/sub2api
  License: LGPL-3.0

Overdraft feature branch:
  https://github.com/DeanZFC/sub2api-overdraft/tree/codex-overdraft
  License: LGPL-3.0

The generated artifacts contain code from those projects plus the versioned UI
overlay in this repository. See build-metadata.json in each release for exact
commits, hashes, and the applied overlay mode.
